<title>USA: Rollins Q1 share purchase at 489,300.</title>
<headline>Rollins Q1 share purchase at 489,300.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer services company Rollins Inc said Thursday it had bought with cash and retired 489,300 shares of its $1.00 par value common stock during its first quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>In October, the company's board of directors approved a plan to buy back up to two million shares. The approval followed the completion of an earlier program to buy back one million shares.</p>
<p>Rollins has more than 30 million shares in circulation.</p>
</text>
